## Rules

- Titles literal and front-loaded; 3 options at packaging; 1–2 loop-grammar
  Shorts per video with the subscribe overlay; template link above the fold.
- Before adding anything new here, regenerate `SLATE-EVIDENCE.md` and grep the
  405-video catalogue in it.
- Default next video = top unchecked row.

