  licence video in a row (wallpapers, real estate) and the channel would read one-note. Two parts:
  (1) home printers have a non-printable margin of roughly three to six millimetres, so a
  full-bleed invitation comes out with white edges; (2) every print dialog defaults to Fit /
  Shrink oversized pages, which scales the design down by a few percent — enough that a five by
  seven card no longer fits a five by seven envelope. Fix: design inside a margin, print at
  ACTUAL SIZE / 100%, and lay up four per A4 with crop marks so the trim cuts through the design.
